      "(1) Her",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi is a doctor. She works in a hospital. She has worked for two years.",
      "Two years ago, Leng Xiaoxi was a student at Xijing University.",
      "At that time, she was studying at Xijing University. She lived at Xijing University.",
      "",
      "Xijing University has lots of cats. Leng Xiaoxi really likes cats. She knows all the cats at Xijing University.",
      "When she ate rice at the restaurant, she fed the cats rice.",
      "When she ate vegetables at the restaurant, she fed the cats vegetables.",
      "When she bought fruit from the fruit store, she fed the cats fruit.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi is now working. She really misses those cats and wants to go back to see them.",
      "Leng Xiaoxi also really misses Xijing University and wants to go back to see her university."
